Read one ASCII digit and print E when even or O when odd
Tape
  cell0 input   cell1 even flag   cell2 odd flag   cell3 scratch
Toggle the two flags once per unit then build the letter

,>+<[->[->>+<<]>[-<+>]>[-<+>]<<<]>>>+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++<[->++++++++++<]>.
